      <div type="clause" n="1.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Mirce">Mirc.</ref> 1.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ðegnes wergild is syx swa micel, þæt bið twelf hund scill'.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A thegn's wergild is six times a much, namely 1200 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ðegenes wergyld is syx swa micel, þæt byð XII hundred scll'.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">The wergild of a thegn is six times as much, that is, twelve hundred shillings.</ab>
      </div>
